  <text id="23:81" name="Same 216 × 106 card as a put-aside window, with the window preview replaced by what alo is doing: • line 1 — alo&#39;s mark and the state, in words (teal only while alo is acting) • line 2 — the task in your own words, one line, ending in … • line 3 — how far it has got • line 4 — the last thing it did that you approved • Stop (navy, 64 × 30) while alo works; Review when it needs you; Open when stopped or done A 3-unit left edge carries the state colour, so the card reads the same in the narrow rail and the lane. Selecting the card (not its button) opens the task window. No preview picture: a task has no window to photograph." x="856" y="370" width="380" height="252" />
