  <text id="23:101" name="Order: newest put aside at the top, windows and tasks together, because the panel answers &quot;what did I put aside&quot;. A task belongs to the Place it was asked on and returns there. Keyboard: F6 reaches the panel; arrows move between cards; Enter opens; Delete on a working task = Stop (asks nothing, reports Stopping… then the result). Full screen: the panel hides with the Dock; a task that needs you raises a notification instead of revealing the panel." x="360" y="730" width="560" height="108" />
